WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:26.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.000 --> 01:30.000
"Tamed"

3
01:33.400 --> 01:36.400
(EP2: Moonlight and Aisles)

4
01:42.239 --> 01:44.005
(Li Meng / Mother of the Cheng brothers) Mom.

5
01:44.159 --> 01:45.480
What brings you here today?

6
01:46.480 --> 01:48.159
Your father's been making some big moves.

7
01:48.439 --> 01:50.000
Everyone's on edge.

8
01:50.840 --> 01:52.400
I asked Zhou Zhi to come.

9
01:52.799 --> 01:54.879
He has a painting by Lin Yuanshan.

10
01:54.879 --> 01:56.079
Take a look at it.

11
01:56.480 --> 01:58.439
See if it can help with the case.

12
01:59.239 --> 02:01.040
What on earth is your father doing?

13
02:01.359 --> 02:03.640
He never tells me anything anymore.

14
02:03.920 --> 02:06.879
(Zhou Zhi) Uncle Cheng's been looking out for himself,

15
02:07.159 --> 02:08.360
ignoring his sons.

16
02:17.800 --> 02:18.599
Yu'an.

17
02:18.800 --> 02:20.919
Yuze hasn't been home in days.

18
02:21.000 --> 02:23.120
You're his big brother. Keep an eye on him.

19
02:23.360 --> 02:24.720
Make sure he stays out of trouble.

20
02:26.080 --> 02:27.080
Wait up!

21
02:27.599 --> 02:28.599
Need a ride.

22
02:32.120 --> 02:33.319
How have you been sleeping?

23
02:35.800 --> 02:37.000
A little better than before.

24
02:37.000 --> 02:39.159
More soundly.

25
02:40.759 --> 02:41.759
That's progress.

26
02:48.360 --> 02:50.599
I wonder if it's the medication...

27
02:57.919 --> 02:58.919
Brother.

28
02:59.280 --> 03:00.680
I was going to call you later.

29
03:00.960 --> 03:02.479
Mom came to see me this morning.

30
03:02.599 --> 03:04.159
She said you haven't been home in days.

31
03:05.080 --> 03:06.080
I knew it.

32
03:06.439 --> 03:07.439
What did she say?

33
03:07.520 --> 03:08.719
To keep an eye on you.

34
03:08.879 --> 03:11.120
So how will you keep an eye on me?

35
03:11.479 --> 03:12.520
Lock me up at home?

36
03:12.840 --> 03:14.520
Or come hang out with me?

37
03:14.680 --> 03:15.680
Where are you now?

38
03:16.000 --> 03:16.800
I'm out.

39
03:16.960 --> 03:18.080
At a friend's guesthouse.

40
03:18.360 --> 03:19.760
A few friends will come over today.

41
03:20.080 --> 03:21.080
You should come, too.

42
03:21.199 --> 03:21.800
I'm busy.

43
03:21.800 --> 03:22.800
I can't get away.

44
03:23.680 --> 03:24.879
Brother.

45
03:24.879 --> 03:26.360
When did you last take a break?

46
03:26.800 --> 03:27.960
I don't need a break.

47
03:28.120 --> 03:29.120
Brother.

48
03:29.280 --> 03:29.960
Come on.

49
03:30.199 --> 03:31.199
I want you here.

50
03:33.319 --> 03:34.360
Send me the address.

51
03:34.840 --> 03:35.360
OK.

52
03:35.360 --> 03:36.360
Right away.

53
03:38.439 --> 03:39.719
Will you be free this afternoon?

54
03:42.000 --> 03:43.879
In theory,

55
03:43.879 --> 03:44.680
yes.

56
03:44.840 --> 03:46.000
Come somewhere with me.

57
03:47.919 --> 03:48.639
It's my younger brother.

58
03:48.919 --> 03:50.000
It won't be a formal session.

59
03:50.000 --> 03:51.000
Just...

60
03:51.560 --> 03:52.439
get to know him a little.

61
03:52.520 --> 03:53.599
Cheng Yu'an.

62
03:53.639 --> 03:55.400
You're crossing professional boundaries...

63
03:55.680 --> 03:56.680
I know.

64
03:58.280 --> 03:59.759
Just meet him as a friend for now.

65
04:00.560 --> 04:01.560
I'll repay you.

66
04:01.599 --> 04:02.599
I'll owe you one.

67
04:09.000 --> 04:10.520
Lawyer Cheng actually showed up!

68
04:11.080 --> 04:12.280
And he brought a friend, too.

69
04:13.479 --> 04:14.400
You're here, too.

70
04:14.479 --> 04:15.439
Where's Cheng Yuze?

71
04:15.439 --> 04:16.439
Upstairs.

72
04:16.600 --> 04:18.319
He said he's inspecting the rooms.

73
04:26.600 --> 04:27.600
Long time no see.

74
04:29.439 --> 04:30.959
You didn't tell me you were back home.

75
04:31.600 --> 04:32.959
Where's the fun in that?

76
04:33.079 --> 04:33.639
Well?

77
04:33.879 --> 04:35.079
Not a bad place, right?

78
04:36.600 --> 04:38.240
Since when is this your thing?

79
04:38.680 --> 04:41.600
(Mu Ye) It always has been. I just never had the chance before.

80
05:11.360 --> 05:12.000
Brother.

81
05:12.000 --> 05:13.040
Who's this?

82
05:15.399 --> 05:16.399
Shen Mo.

83
05:17.439 --> 05:18.600
A therapist.

84
05:19.160 --> 05:20.160
That's perfect.

85
05:20.959 --> 05:23.240
I haven't been sleeping well lately.

86
05:23.839 --> 05:25.240
Though I slept great last night.

87
05:26.399 --> 05:27.319
Dr. Shen.

88
05:27.319 --> 05:29.639
Could I get a private bedtime session?

89
05:35.439 --> 05:36.360
Forgive him.

90
05:36.360 --> 05:37.440
He's always fooling around.

91
05:38.639 --> 05:39.639
It's fine.

92
05:40.839 --> 05:42.079
Everyone's here, right?

93
05:42.079 --> 05:43.120
Don't just stand there.

94
05:43.639 --> 05:44.360
Mu Ye.

95
05:44.439 --> 05:45.240
Where's the wine?

96
05:45.240 --> 05:45.839
Open a bottle.

97
05:46.040 --> 05:47.160
You said a few friends.

98
05:47.480 --> 05:49.160
You didn't say Mu Ye owned the guesthouse.

99
05:49.199 --> 05:50.000
It's a surprise.

100
05:50.160 --> 05:51.399
Don't you like surprises?

101
06:04.439 --> 06:05.240
Brother Yu'an.

102
06:05.264 --> 06:06.250
Do you have a pet, too?

103
06:15.079 --> 06:16.079
I do.

104
06:20.959 --> 06:21.959
Come on, guys.

105
06:22.360 --> 06:23.720
Make yourselves at home.

106
06:23.720 --> 06:25.199
Kick back and relax.

107
06:25.360 --> 06:27.240
There's plenty of booze to go around.

108
06:29.480 --> 06:30.480
Thanks.

109
06:31.959 --> 06:32.720
Come on.

110
06:32.879 --> 06:33.680
Let's take

111
06:33.680 --> 06:35.879
a group photo to celebrate our opening.

112
06:35.879 --> 06:36.879
Sound good?

113
06:37.560 --> 06:38.560
Come on, everyone.

114
06:48.680 --> 06:50.040
Wake up, Sesame.

115
06:50.279 --> 06:50.720
OK.

116
06:50.720 --> 06:51.759
Is everyone ready?

117
06:52.000 --> 06:53.000
Look at the camera.

118
06:54.079 --> 06:55.079
3.

119
06:55.959 --> 06:57.000
2.

120
06:58.160 --> 06:59.160
1.

121
07:04.800 --> 07:05.360
Cheers!

122
07:05.360 --> 07:05.759
Cheers!

123
07:05.759 --> 07:06.759
Cheers!

124
07:09.639 --> 07:10.680
Just drinking is boring.

125
07:10.879 --> 07:11.879
Let's play a game.

126
07:12.360 --> 07:13.360
Truth or dare?

127
07:13.360 --> 07:14.360
I'm in.

128
07:16.759 --> 07:17.759
Truth.

129
07:18.000 --> 07:19.000
Zhou Zhi.

130
07:19.199 --> 07:21.639
When did you last say what you didn't mean?

131
07:22.560 --> 07:23.560
This morning.

132
07:24.279 --> 07:24.879
This morning?

133
07:25.199 --> 07:26.199
What did you say?

134
07:26.439 --> 07:27.480
That's another question.

135
07:27.639 --> 07:28.519
Ask on my next turn.

136
07:28.519 --> 07:29.480
Such a spoilsport.

137
07:29.519 --> 07:30.040
My turn!

138
07:30.040 --> 07:30.879
Ready?

139
07:30.879 --> 07:31.199
3.

140
07:31.199 --> 07:31.480
2.

141
07:31.480 --> 07:32.480
1.

142
07:33.399 --> 07:34.959
I'll go with truth, too.

143
07:35.319 --> 07:37.160
Is there someone

144
07:37.160 --> 07:39.040
you're really into,

145
07:39.240 --> 07:40.439
someone you can't forget?

146
07:50.759 --> 07:51.759
Yes.

147
07:52.079 --> 07:52.879
Last night.

148
07:53.079 --> 07:54.079
That recent?

149
07:56.399 --> 07:57.399
I'm serious.

150
07:58.920 --> 07:59.920
Really?

151
08:01.079 --> 08:02.120
Come on, let's keep going.

152
08:05.720 --> 08:06.720
OK.

153
08:06.959 --> 08:08.360
Truth or dare?

154
08:09.480 --> 08:10.480
Dare.

155
08:16.519 --> 08:17.519
OK, then.

156
08:18.639 --> 08:20.839
The third person to your right...

157
08:20.839 --> 08:22.959
Hold their gaze for 30 seconds.

158
08:27.519 --> 08:28.120
Come on.

159
08:28.120 --> 08:28.759
Thirty seconds.

160
08:28.800 --> 08:29.800
I'll time you.

161
08:30.360 --> 08:31.439
3.

162
08:31.439 --> 08:32.279
2.

163
08:32.279 --> 08:33.159
1.

164
08:33.159 --> 08:34.159
Go!

165
08:54.600 --> 08:55.600
No backing out.

166
09:04.895 --> 09:06.968
[Party A Signature: Lin Qi]

167
09:13.960 --> 09:16.799
29.2.

168
09:16.799 --> 09:17.159
Kidding.

169
09:17.159 --> 09:18.159
30!

170
09:19.759 --> 09:20.759
You did it!

171
09:29.080 --> 09:30.679
I'll go to the bathroom.

172
09:48.080 --> 09:49.080
Sesame.

173
09:54.639 --> 09:55.639
Sesame.

174
09:56.600 --> 09:57.600
Sesame.

175
09:59.600 --> 10:00.600
Take your pick.

176
10:01.559 --> 10:02.559
Dare.

177
10:03.360 --> 10:04.039
OK.

178
10:04.039 --> 10:06.159
Call that person you like.

179
10:06.320 --> 10:07.480
The one from last night.

180
10:14.960 --> 10:16.279
I didn't get their number.

181
10:16.279 --> 10:17.240
No way!

182
10:17.240 --> 10:18.240
I really didn't.

183
10:18.440 --> 10:19.679
Then take your penalty.

184
10:19.679 --> 10:20.759
You just won't call.

185
10:20.759 --> 10:21.759
Drink up!

186
10:22.039 --> 10:23.039
Then drink mine, too.

187
10:23.159 --> 10:23.759
Pour it.

188
10:23.840 --> 10:24.880
I'll take a drink for him.

189
10:27.039 --> 10:27.879
Drink up!

190
10:27.879 --> 10:28.480
Wait...

191
10:28.480 --> 10:30.600
Since when can you call for backup?

192
10:31.120 --> 10:32.320
OK.

193
10:33.360 --> 10:34.400
Come on, let's keep going.

194
10:43.559 --> 10:44.679
I'll step out for a bit.

195
10:58.399 --> 10:59.399
Sesame.

196
11:00.679 --> 11:01.679
Sesame.

197
11:05.379 --> 11:06.379
Sesame.

198
11:08.720 --> 11:09.720
Sesame.

199
11:10.559 --> 11:11.559
Sesame.

200
11:23.399 --> 11:24.799
The cat got out.

201
11:26.399 --> 11:27.399
I know.

202
11:37.080 --> 11:38.080
Found it?

203
11:38.879 --> 11:39.440
No.

204
11:39.440 --> 11:41.200
It ran down there.

205
12:13.399 --> 12:14.759
I think the door's locked.

206
12:15.960 --> 12:16.960
What do we do?

207
12:26.200 --> 12:26.799
I'll...

208
12:26.799 --> 12:27.799
I'll go check.

209
12:40.080 --> 12:41.080
What do we do?

210
12:46.600 --> 12:47.600
Canned cat food.

211
12:48.039 --> 12:49.039
Lure it out.

212
13:11.679 --> 13:12.960
Let's go, puppy.

213
13:19.639 --> 13:20.639
Sesame.

214
13:38.320 --> 13:40.879
So this is where you're hiding, Dr. Shen.

215
13:42.480 --> 13:43.480
Getting some air.

216
13:54.080 --> 13:55.080
It's sweet.

217
13:55.759 --> 13:56.799
You slipped some sugar in?

218
13:59.919 --> 14:00.919
Need something?

219
14:08.039 --> 14:08.960
What do you think,

220
14:08.960 --> 14:09.960
Dr. Shen?

221
14:11.679 --> 14:13.600
You started it last night.

222
14:13.879 --> 14:15.080
You didn't say no.

223
14:15.279 --> 14:17.120
There's plenty I don't say no to.

224
14:18.000 --> 14:20.480
Then don't say no now, either.

225
14:26.600 --> 14:27.600
Cheng Yuze.

226
14:28.600 --> 14:30.480
You're here on vacation. So am I.

227
14:30.879 --> 14:32.879
Last night was an accident.

228
14:33.240 --> 14:35.039
It doesn't mean we have to keep this going.

229
14:41.919 --> 14:42.919
An accident?

230
14:44.679 --> 14:46.039
We're both adults.

231
14:48.080 --> 14:49.080
I want to know

232
14:49.799 --> 14:51.039
what I am to you.

233
14:52.200 --> 14:53.440
A one-night stand?

234
14:54.200 --> 14:55.279
Or...

235
14:56.399 --> 14:57.879
do you think about last night, too?

236
15:00.320 --> 15:01.240
Just call it an accident.

237
15:01.240 --> 15:02.720
But I don't think it was an accident.

238
15:13.120 --> 15:14.360
You'll regret this.

239
15:18.639 --> 15:19.759
I won't.

240
15:21.279 --> 15:22.879
You're the one who'll regret it.

241
15:23.440 --> 15:25.159
Because you want this so badly,

242
15:26.240 --> 15:27.320
but you won't admit it.

243
15:30.320 --> 15:31.320
Cheng Yuze.

244
15:36.320 --> 15:37.399
Call me Zafe.

245
15:43.399 --> 15:44.399
I'll head back first.

246
16:21.080 --> 16:22.320
Extra session tomorrow morning.

247
16:22.960 --> 16:24.406
[Secretary] OK.

248
16:29.566 --> 16:31.092
[Lin Qi posted a photo with no caption on his Wechat 1 hour ago]

249
16:37.119 --> 16:39.499
[Convo with Lin Qi. Previous message was the "pet" agreement. Now he's typing "Good night."]

250
17:26.039 --> 17:26.720
Brother.

251
17:26.920 --> 17:28.359
Look at you, all domestic.

252
17:28.599 --> 17:30.199
I thought I'd walked onto the wrong set.

253
17:30.400 --> 17:31.400
Where's Dr. Shen?

254
17:31.440 --> 17:32.759
Just eat your fruit.

255
17:33.480 --> 17:35.000
Something came up at his clinic.

256
17:35.000 --> 17:36.000
He left early.

257
17:36.559 --> 17:37.319
Xiao Ze.

258
17:37.519 --> 17:38.959
Call your friend down for breakfast.

259
17:39.160 --> 17:39.960
Lin Qi?

260
17:39.960 --> 17:41.416
He got a call first thing this morning.

261
17:41.440 --> 17:42.200
Something came up.

262
17:42.200 --> 17:43.200
He left, too.

263
17:43.599 --> 17:44.039
He left?

264
17:44.039 --> 17:44.359
Yeah.

265
17:44.359 --> 17:45.359
You were all up so early.

266
17:45.359 --> 17:46.519
Did you black out last night?

267
17:46.680 --> 17:47.759
As if!

268
17:47.759 --> 17:49.000
You know I can hold my liquor.

269
17:49.160 --> 17:50.279
Keep telling yourself that.

270
17:52.640 --> 17:53.680
If you ask me,

271
17:54.039 --> 17:55.839
when your guesthouse goes public,

272
17:56.359 --> 17:57.680
your brand ambassador

273
17:57.799 --> 17:58.759
has to be Xiao Ze.

274
17:58.759 --> 17:59.759
Right?

275
18:00.079 --> 18:01.279
I couldn't afford him.

276
18:03.000 --> 18:03.640
Dad.

277
18:03.880 --> 18:06.440
Your brother dropped out without telling us

278
18:06.440 --> 18:07.400
to play in some band.

279
18:07.440 --> 18:09.079
Go bring him home right now.

280
18:09.440 --> 18:10.680
He doesn't want to come home.

281
18:11.039 --> 18:12.200
Dragging him back

282
18:12.640 --> 18:13.799
will only make things worse.

283
18:14.079 --> 18:15.279
Then what do you suggest?

284
18:15.400 --> 18:17.240
He's never listened to a word I say.

285
18:17.400 --> 18:19.519
His defiance will get him into big trouble.

286
18:19.559 --> 18:21.799
I'll arrange psychological counselin with Cheng Group's doctors.

287
18:22.759 --> 18:24.200
Once he's doing better,

288
18:24.480 --> 18:25.599
he can come home.

289
18:26.359 --> 18:27.359
OK.

290
18:27.559 --> 18:28.559
But...

291
18:28.839 --> 18:29.960
I want to meet up first.

292
18:30.960 --> 18:31.960
I'll arrange it.

293
18:35.400 --> 18:36.480
By then, Xiao Ze will

294
18:36.480 --> 18:38.240
tour the world, right?

295
18:38.480 --> 18:39.519
We'll have to show our support.

296
18:39.519 --> 18:41.559
He'll have so many fans by then.

297
18:41.920 --> 18:43.160
Tickets will be like impossible to get.

298
18:43.240 --> 18:44.640
We'll be lucky to even see him.

299
18:46.720 --> 18:47.319
Brother.

300
18:47.319 --> 18:48.000
Your car keys.

301
18:48.240 --> 18:50.040
I need to get Lin Qi from the police station.

302
18:51.480 --> 18:53.079
You have something more important to do.

303
18:53.079 --> 18:54.936
Go through the motions at at Shen Mo's clinic.

304
18:54.960 --> 18:55.759
Otherwise,

305
18:55.839 --> 18:57.599
Dad will shave off your puppy fur tonight.

306
18:57.759 --> 18:59.759
But Lin Qi's already at the station.

307
18:59.759 --> 19:00.680
I need to pick him up.

308
19:00.680 --> 19:01.680
I'll get him.

309
19:03.279 --> 19:04.319
OK.

310
19:04.599 --> 19:06.319
You're better at getting people out anyway.

311
19:06.456 --> 19:07.815
I'll go get my fur stroked, then.

312
19:07.839 --> 19:10.559
I've sent you the contact info and address for Shen Mo's clinic.

313
19:24.079 --> 19:25.079
You fight, too?

314
19:26.799 --> 19:28.119
They went after my mom.

315
19:28.119 --> 19:29.359
What else was I supposed to do?

316
19:43.319 --> 19:44.319
Does it still hurt?

317
19:47.359 --> 19:48.839
It didn't before you touched it.

318
19:49.240 --> 19:50.480
Now it does.

319
19:53.720 --> 19:54.880
Don't be scared, Xiao Qi.

320
19:55.119 --> 19:56.599
Daddy will be back soon.

321
20:01.839 --> 20:03.000
Dad!

322
20:03.000 --> 20:04.519
Xiao Qi got hit by a car!

323
20:04.799 --> 20:06.279
Please save it!

324
20:07.240 --> 20:08.440
It's just a dog.

325
20:09.559 --> 20:10.559
Get rid of it.

326
20:15.039 --> 20:16.240
You're filthy.

327
20:16.559 --> 20:17.559
Go take a bath.

328
20:21.079 --> 20:22.200
But...

329
20:29.880 --> 20:30.880
So...

330
20:32.039 --> 20:33.480
you were waiting for me to help?

331
20:37.400 --> 20:38.400
Yeah.

332
20:48.599 --> 20:49.599
Come in.

333
20:49.680 --> 20:50.680
It's drafty by the door.

334
20:50.720 --> 20:51.759
Aren't you cold?

335
21:01.200 --> 21:02.400
Take your clothes off.

336
21:02.400 --> 21:03.400
Can you move your hands?

337
21:04.400 --> 21:05.400
Yes.

338
21:07.039 --> 21:08.400
The water will get cold soon.

339
21:12.472 --> 21:14.712
Could you turn around?

340
22:04.200 --> 22:05.200
Sit up a little.

341
22:26.720 --> 22:28.279
That feels pretty good.

342
22:29.119 --> 22:30.119
Stop moving.

343
22:31.640 --> 22:32.640
OK.

344
22:36.920 --> 22:38.720
A little more pressure.

345
22:47.400 --> 22:48.720
You're pretty demanding.

346
22:56.240 --> 22:58.519
When I was signing documents at the station today,

347
22:59.279 --> 23:00.880
my hand wouldn't stop shaking.

348
23:05.599 --> 23:07.640
My hands never shake when I paint.

349
23:19.480 --> 23:20.480
Close your eyes.

350
23:20.680 --> 23:22.920
Move again and I'll throw you out.

351
23:49.359 --> 23:50.039
Brother.

352
23:50.279 --> 23:51.319
Are you home?

353
23:52.319 --> 23:53.319
Brother?

354
23:53.880 --> 23:54.880
Where are you?

355
23:57.916 --> 23:59.723
[Episode 2: done]

356
24:00.039 --> 24:01.440
A few friends will come over today.

357
24:01.880 --> 24:02.839
You should come, too.

358
24:02.839 --> 24:03.359
I'm busy.

359
24:03.359 --> 24:04.359
I don't have time.

360
24:05.599 --> 24:06.039
Lin Qi.

361
24:06.319 --> 24:07.639
Help me get another case of wine.

362
24:12.519 --> 24:13.559
Send me the address.

363
24:15.920 --> 24:17.595
(Next Episode) Even if it's playing with fire,

364
24:17.619 --> 24:18.700
and I get burned,

365
24:19.500 --> 24:20.700
I'm willing to take that risk.

366
24:21.220 --> 24:22.220
Keep an eye on him.

367
24:22.559 --> 24:23.839
Don't let him out of your sight.

368
24:24.200 --> 24:25.200
Understood.

369
24:29.579 --> 24:32.180
Lin Yuanshan's sketches, unpublished when he died,

370
24:32.519 --> 24:33.519
or

371
24:33.779 --> 24:36.299
the whereabouts of his missing son.

372
24:36.960 --> 24:38.299
Give me either one,

373
24:38.779 --> 24:39.839
and we'll call it even.
